Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: StrBytes - ASCII byte list of a string (Core.Ord per char)

    Function
        Name: StrBytes
        Params: s
        Returns: out
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.List
            Params:
            Returns: out
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.StrLen
            Params: s
            Returns: n
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, n
            Returns: cont
        Loop
            Condition: cont
            Body
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.StrSub
                    Params: s, i, 1
                    Returns: ch
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.Ord
                    Params: ch
                    Returns: c
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: out, c
                    Returns: out
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, n
                    Returns: cont
        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            State: Ok
